// MARK: - Gua: account genesis

/* Shown on the phone entry screen when this device meant to register an account genesis at signup
   and could not. Deliberately a failure rather than a silent fallback: an account created without
   the genesis it intended would be indistinguishable afterwards. */
"gua_account_genesis_setup_failed" = "We couldn’t finish setting up your account on this device. Please try again.";

